#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:10
msgid "STM32F4 system integration"
msgstr "STM32F4 系统集成"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:12
msgid ""
"These headers are exact STM32F4 system composition contracts rather than "
"portable I/O faces. Follow each header's part, privilege, clock, memory and "
"retained-resource requirements; public visibility does not extend it to "
"another device."
msgstr ""
"这些头文件是精确 STM32F4 系统装配合同，不是可移植 I/O "
"接口。须遵循各头文件的料号、权限、时钟、内存及保留资源要求；公共可见性不将其扩展到其他器件。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:17
msgid "Selected F407 entropy owner"
msgstr "所选 F407 熵源 owner"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:19
msgid "Select the chip's one internal RNG through the authored assembly:"
msgstr "通过 authored assembly 选择芯片内唯一的 RNG："

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:28
msgid ""
"The Board supplies the pinless `rng` binding. Configuration requires the "
"selected nominal PLL48 domain to be exactly 48 MHz, including an explicit "
"`pll48 = true` reservation when SYSCLK uses a direct input. The generated "
"`nx_factory_entropy(NX_ENTROPY_ID_RANDOM)` returns an existing readonly "
"{doc}`entropy face </reference/api/io/system>` without starting hardware. No"
" separate CMake constructor, public mutable owner or second clock "
"configuration is used."
msgstr ""
"Board 提供无引脚的 `rng` binding。配置要求所选标称 PLL48 域恰好为 48 MHz；SYSCLK 使用直接输入时，还须显式预留 "
"`pll48 = true`。生成的 `nx_factory_entropy(NX_ENTROPY_ID_RANDOM)` 返回已有只读{doc}`熵源"
" face </reference/api/io/system>`，不启动硬件。不使用独立 CMake 构造器、公开可变 owner 或第二套时钟配置。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:36
msgid ""
"Readonly admission rejects foreign enabled RNG or IRQ state before System "
"clock effects. Platform prepares the same private RNG owner after System "
"startup, withdraws it before clock shutdown or suspend, and prepares it "
"again in the new epoch on resume. The existing C implementation checks the "
"actual RCC/Flash plan and retains its acquired gate and enable effects "
"through cleanup. Join every entropy, TLS and network consumer before "
"serialized privileged Platform suspend or stop. Failed withdrawal retains "
"that owner and cleanup responsibility; retry the lifecycle operation without"
" resetting its state. A cold or stopped face remains valid and rejects data "
"calls with STATE. Clock failure or an epoch change stops data publication "
"while cleanup remains available."
msgstr ""
"只读 admission 在 System 时钟产生影响前拒绝外来已使能的 RNG 或 IRQ 状态。Platform 在 System "
"启动后准备同一个私有 RNG owner，在时钟关闭或 suspend 前撤回，并在 resume 的新 epoch 中重新准备。已有 C 实现核对实际"
" RCC/Flash 计划，并在清理期间保留已取得 gate 和 enable 影响的责任。在串行化、特权 Platform suspend 或 "
"stop 前，必须 join 所有熵源、TLS 和网络消费者。撤回失败保留 owner 和清理责任；重试生命周期操作时不可重置其状态。冷态或已停止的 "
"face 仍有效，数据调用返回 STATE。时钟故障或 epoch 改变后停止数据发布，清理仍可执行。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:47
msgid ""
"The [System contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/system/README.md) defines clock "
"authority and recovery. RNG health checks and software models establish "
"neither physical min-entropy nor HIL qualification."
msgstr ""
"[System 合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/system/README.md)定义时钟权威与恢复。RNG 健康检查和软件模型均不能证明物理最小熵或"
" HIL 资格。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:51
msgid ""
"The chip-specific entry is `nexus/soc/stm32f407_handoff.h`, owned by the [F4"
" System contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/system/README.md#f407-掩码状态下的镜像交接). "
"Link `Nexus::STM32F407Handoff` explicitly in the selected F407 baremetal "
"firmware."
msgstr ""
"芯片专用入口为 `nexus/soc/stm32f407_handoff.h`，归 [F4 System "
"合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/system/README.md#f407-掩码状态下的镜像交接)所有。在选定的 F407 "
"裸机固件中显式链接 `Nexus::STM32F407Handoff`。"

