#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "Publish one bounded first-fault snapshot without allocation or locks."
msgstr "无分配、无锁地发布一份有界首故障快照。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid ""
"Privileged Thread/IRQ/NMI/fault. Does not walk an untrusted stack or infer "
"the FPU/extended frame layout. Caller accounts for EXC_RETURN, stack limits "
"and stacking errors before supplying frame. No tick, transport, observer, "
"reset, cleanup or persistence write is invoked."
msgstr ""
"限特权 Thread／IRQ／NMI／fault 上下文。不遍历不可信栈，不推断 FPU／扩展帧布局。调用者在提供 frame 前处理 "
"EXC_RETURN、栈限制及压栈错误。不调用 tick、传输、观察者、复位、清理或持久化写入。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "[inout] Distinct static zero storage; retained after capture."
msgstr "[inout] 独立的静态全零存储；捕获后保持保留。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "[in] Product-selected raw diagnostic value, never policy."
msgstr "[in] 产品选择的原始诊断值，不代表策略。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "[in] Raw fault entry EXC_RETURN, not dereferenced."
msgstr "[in] 故障入口的原始 EXC_RETURN，不解引用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "[in] Optional caller-validated accessible basic frame or NULL."
msgstr "[in] 可选、经调用者验证可访问的基本帧，或 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY for an earlier/nested capture, INVALID/CONTEXT."
msgstr "SUCCESS；已有／嵌套捕获返回 BUSY；或 INVALID／CONTEXT。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "Copy an acquire-published immutable first-fault record."
msgstr "复制以 release 发布、由 acquire 读取的不可变首故障记录。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid ""
"Bounded, no MMIO and no clock dependency. Checksum detects simple "
"corruption; it does not authenticate a record or promise retention."
msgstr "有界，无 MMIO 及时钟依赖。校验和检测简单损坏，不认证记录，也不保证保留性。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "[in] Retained provider-owned snapshot, never concurrently reset."
msgstr "[in] 保留的 provider 所有快照，不得并发重置。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "[out] Distinct complete call-owned record."
msgstr "[out] 独立完整、由调用者在本次调用拥有的记录。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/IO, leaving output unchanged on failure."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID／STATE／IO；失败时输出不变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "Explicitly acknowledge all raw RCC reset flags after capture."
msgstr "捕获后显式确认全部原始 RCC 复位标志。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid ""
"Serialized privileged Thread; RMVF clears the complete flag group. No "
"selective clear or automatic acknowledgement is invented."
msgstr "串行化的特权 Thread 上下文；RMVF 清除整组标志。不虚构选择性清除或自动确认。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, CONTEXT, STATE before startup capture, or IO. The captured "
"nx_reset_cause stays unchanged across STOP or a clock restart."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS、CONTEXT、启动捕获前的 STATE，或 IO。捕获的 nx_reset_cause 在 STOP 或时钟重启后保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "Request a system reset and retain masks if hardware has not reset."
msgstr "请求系统复位；硬件尚未复位时保持中断掩码。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid ""
"Explicit privileged product action, Thread or exception context. Preserves "
"AIRCR priority grouping, writes the required key, issues barriers and parks "
"until reset. Does not reclaim borrows, imply a successful reset, change "
"backup policy or write a retention record."
msgstr ""
"产品显式授权的特权动作，限 Thread 或异常上下文。保留 AIRCR "
"优先级分组，写入所需密钥，执行屏障并停驻直到复位。不回收借用、不暗示复位成功、不改变备份策略，也不写保留记录。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "Enable or disable DWT cycle tracing after explicit product selection."
msgstr "产品显式选择后启用或禁用 DWT 周期跟踪。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid ""
"Serialized privileged Thread owns debugger/DWT access. No SWO pin, ITM "
"transport or wall-clock source is selected. CYCCNT halts in STOP and changes"
" rate with HCLK; modulo deltas require less than one wrap."
msgstr ""
"串行化的特权 Thread 拥有调试器／DWT 访问权。不选择 SWO 引脚、ITM 传输或墙上时钟源。CYCCNT 在 STOP 停止，速率随 "
"HCLK 变化；模差计算要求间隔少于一次回绕。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "[in] Selected CYCCNT state; disabling leaves shared TRCENA on."
msgstr "[in] 选定 CYCCNT 状态；禁用时保持共享 TRCENA 开启。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "[in] Explicitly reset CYCCNT, only when enabling."
msgstr "[in] 显式重置 CYCCNT，仅在启用时允许。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "[out] Distinct call-owned actual enabled/cycle/frequency state."
msgstr "[out] 独立调用期输出，反映实际启用／周期／频率状态。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/CONTEXT/UNSUPPORTED/IO before false success."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID／CONTEXT／UNSUPPORTED／IO，不得虚报成功。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "Basic exception frame selected and validated by the fault entry."
msgstr "由故障入口选择并验证的基本异常帧。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "Public Members"
msgstr "公共成员"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "Caller-owned first-fault record, optionally placed in noinit RAM."
msgstr "调用者拥有的首故障记录，可放置于 noinit RAM。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid ""
"Zero-initialize before first use. The provider owns every field after "
"capture. Readers and storage survive all nested reporters. noinit does not "
"guarantee reset/power retention; Standby loses SRAM and CCM."
msgstr ""
"首次使用前全零初始化。捕获后所有字段归 provider 所有。读者及存储须在全部嵌套报告者存活期间保持有效。noinit "
"不保证复位／断电保留；Standby 丢失 SRAM 和 CCM。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:64
msgid "An explicitly enabled cycle trace is separate from monotonic time."
msgstr "显式启用的周期跟踪独立于单调时间。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:68
msgid "stm32f407_wwdg_ewi.h"
msgstr "stm32f407_wwdg_ewi.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
msgid "Caller-owned sticky WWDG early-warning observation."
msgstr "调用者拥有的粘滞 WWDG 提前预警观测。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
msgid "Enable irreversible EWI after explicit watchdog activation."
msgstr "显式激活看门狗后启用不可逆的 EWI。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
msgid ""
"Serialized privileged Thread, masks clear. Caller has installed the sole "
"WWDG vector calling ewi_irq(warning). No worker, callback or feed policy is "
"installed. Sticky EWI and its storage cannot be reclaimed before reset, even"
" after failed NVIC enable or a reset request."
msgstr ""
"限串行化、特权 Thread 上下文，传入中断掩码须清除。调用者已安装唯一 WWDG 向量并调用 "
"ewi_irq(warning)。不安装工作线程、回调或喂狗策略。粘滞 EWI 及其存储在复位前不得回收，即使 NVIC 启用失败或已请求复位。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
msgid "[inout] Distinct static zero storage, retained on effects."
msgstr "[inout] 独立静态全零存储，出现副作用后保留。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
msgid "[in] Stable prepared/enabled F407 window-watchdog face."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、已准备／启用的 F407 窗口看门狗接口。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
msgid "[in] Logical WWDG IRQ priority, 0..15."
msgstr "[in] 逻辑 WWDG IRQ 优先级，0..15。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY/IO; retained reports effects."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID／CONTEXT／STATE／BUSY／IO；retained 报告副作用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
msgid "Acknowledge one raw warning and latch its occurrence, without feed."
msgstr "确认一次原始预警并锁存其发生，不喂狗。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
msgid ""
"WWDG IRQ only, privileged single writer. Failure retains all owners; no "
"watchdog reload, reset, cleanup or product recovery is attempted."
msgstr "仅限 WWDG IRQ，特权单写入者。失败保留全部所有者；不尝试看门狗重载、复位、清理或产品恢复。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
msgid "[inout] Exact retained object passed to arm."
msgstr "[inout] 传给 arm 的精确保留对象。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
msgid "SUCCESS, STATE when no event, IO on failed acknowledgement."
msgstr "SUCCESS；无事件返回 STATE；确认失败返回 IO。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
msgid "Read the saturating warning count and explicit lost-count fact."
msgstr "读取饱和预警计数及显式丢计数事实。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
msgid "Privileged Thread/configurable IRQ; saved mask protects the snapshot."
msgstr "限特权 Thread／可配置 IRQ；保存的掩码保护快照。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
msgid "[in] Exact retained object, no concurrent arm/reclamation."
msgstr "[in] 精确保留对象，不允许并发 arm 或回收。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
msgid "[out] Distinct call-owned count, accessed only here."
msgstr "[out] 独立调用期计数，仅在此处访问。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
msgid "[out] Distinct call-owned saturation observation."
msgstr "[out] 独立调用期饱和观测。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE without withdrawing any source."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID／CONTEXT／STATE，不撤回任何来源。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
msgid "Zero-initialized optional storage, retained through hardware reset."
msgstr "全零初始化的可选存储，须保留到硬件复位。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:70
msgid "Fields are provider-owned after arm, never copied or reset by caller."
msgstr "arm 后字段归 provider 所有，调用者不得复制或重置。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:74
msgid "stm32f4_power.h"
msgstr "stm32f4_power.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "Explicit drained STOP/Standby and time-domain receipts."
msgstr "显式排空后的 STOP／Standby 及时间域回执。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "Defines"
msgstr "宏定义"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "Observe live retained flags without acknowledging or clearing them."
msgstr "观测活动保留标志，不确认或清除。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "Privileged unmasked Thread with the selected System/PWR owner live."
msgstr "限特权、未屏蔽中断的 Thread，且所选 System／PWR 所有者活动。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "[out] Separate caller-owned output, never retained."
msgstr "[out] 独立的调用者输出，不保留。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE, output unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID／CONTEXT／STATE；拒绝时输出不变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "Prepare the explicit F479 RTC-Standby reset workaround."
msgstr "准备显式 F479 RTC-Standby 复位规避措施。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid ""
"Product-authorized privileged unmasked Thread with live System/PWR. Clears "
"only SBF, leaving WUF, RTC and other retained state intact. SUCCESS obliges "
"the caller to perform its authorized system reset; it never means RTC "
"Standby is rearmed. This function never resets."
msgstr ""
"产品授权的特权、未屏蔽中断 Thread，System／PWR 须活动。仅清除 SBF，保留 WUF、RTC 及其他保留状态。SUCCESS "
"要求调用者执行其已授权的系统复位，绝不表示 RTC Standby 已重新使能。本函数不执行复位。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "[in] Positive bound for observing SBF acknowledgment."
msgstr "[in] 观察 SBF 确认的正数上限。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after SBF is cleared; IO on refused acknowledgment; "
"INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE or UNSUPPORTED on other maintained parts."
msgstr ""
"SBF 清除后返回 SUCCESS；确认遭拒返回 IO；或 INVALID／CONTEXT／STATE；其他维护中的料号返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "Enter STOP or WKUP-only Standby after explicit consumer drain."
msgstr "显式排空消费者后进入 STOP 或仅 WKUP 的 Standby。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid ""
"Privileged serialized Thread, incoming masks clear. The owner joins devices "
"and DMA, disables SysTick and suspends/rebuilds OS timing. The closed 150 "
"MHz RUN/SDIO high-speed profile rejects deep sleep without hardware writes, "
"epoch changes or retained references. An assembled Platform must "
"successfully suspend first. A disabled hardware gate does not prove that "
"logical deadline borrowers drained. STOP wake_events selects EXTI17/21/22 "
"EMR/RTSR and one WFE; otherwise exact enabled wake_irqs select WFI. Standby "
"selects WFI; an enabled RTC domain requires standby_enter and its prepared "
"RTC owner receipt. Spurious returns are allowed. No SEV/WFE sequence "
"discards an event. Hardware additionally rejects live DMA, peripheral gates,"
" old pending SysTick and undeclared enabled IRQs. STOP clears no pending "
"flags. Standby disables EWUP before CWUF and rearms the selected WKUP "
"source; existing WUF requires discard_wakeup. Old deadlines end with "
"old_epoch. No kernel tick or old deadline is resumed. VBAT policy is "
"external. An unrecoverable restore keeps masks/owners, observes and parks. "
"Real Standby resets and does not return; SRAM/CCM retention is absent."
msgstr ""
"限特权、串行化 Thread，传入中断掩码须清除。所有者 join 设备和 DMA、禁用 SysTick，并挂起／重建 OS 计时。已封闭的 150 "
"MHz RUN／SDIO 高速配置拒绝深睡眠，不写硬件、不改变纪元、不保留引用。已装配 Platform "
"必须先成功挂起。硬件门控已禁用不证明逻辑截止时间借用者已排空。STOP 的 wake_events 选择 EXTI17／21／22 的 EMR／RTSR"
" 及一次 WFE；否则由精确已启用 wake_irqs 选择 WFI。Standby 使用 WFI；RTC 域已启用时须使用 standby_enter"
" 及已准备的 RTC 所有者回执。允许伪唤醒返回。不使用会丢弃事件的 SEV／WFE 序列。硬件还拒绝活动 DMA、外设门控、旧待处理 SysTick "
"及未声明的已启用 IRQ。STOP 不清除待处理标志。Standby 在 CWUF 前禁用 EWUP，再重新使能选定 WKUP 来源；已有 WUF "
"时必须提供 discard_wakeup。旧截止时间随 old_epoch 结束。不恢复内核 tick 或旧截止时间。VBAT "
"策略由外部负责。无法恢复时保留掩码及所有者，记录观测后停驻。真实 Standby 会复位而不返回，SRAM／CCM 不保留。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid ""
"[in] Current closed, empty domain enrolling every clock and deadline "
"borrower, including external OS consumers."
msgstr "[in] 当前已封闭、为空的域，纳入所有时钟和截止时间借用者，包括外部 OS 消费者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "[in] Stable call-owned options and exact enabled wake IRQs."
msgstr "[in] 稳定调用期选项及精确已启用的唤醒 IRQ。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "[out] Distinct call-owned output, never retained."
msgstr "[out] 独立调用期输出，不保留。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after STOP restoration; BUSY/STATE/CONTEXT before effects; "
"UNSUPPORTED for a RUN-only profile; IO if Standby WFI returns and a new RUN "
"epoch is restored."
msgstr ""
"STOP 恢复后返回 SUCCESS；产生副作用前可返回 BUSY／STATE／CONTEXT；仅 RUN 配置返回 "
"UNSUPPORTED；Standby 的 WFI 返回且恢复新 RUN 纪元后返回 IO。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "Request Standby using the unique RTC owner's prepared wake receipt."
msgstr "使用唯一 RTC 所有者准备的唤醒回执请求 Standby。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid ""
"Privileged serialized Thread, incoming masks clear. RTC prepare explicitly "
"authorizes any business-event discard. This call validates disabled RTC "
"sources, disables EWUP, clears WUF, commits RTC sources and rearms EWUP "
"before WFI. It never writes RTC or EXTI registers. Spurious return restores "
"RUN and RTC ownership without clearing new wake events. No pending business "
"event is implicitly consumed."
msgstr ""
"限特权、串行化 Thread，传入中断掩码须清除。RTC prepare 显式授权丢弃业务事件。本调用验证已禁用 RTC 来源、禁用 EWUP、清除 "
"WUF、提交 RTC 来源，并在 WFI 前重新使能 EWUP。绝不写 RTC 或 EXTI 寄存器。伪返回恢复 RUN 和 RTC "
"所有权，不清除新唤醒事件。不隐式消费待处理业务事件。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "[in] Closed, drained domain as for power_enter."
msgstr "[in] 已封闭并排空的域，要求同 power_enter。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid ""
"[in] Stable options with standby=true; discard_wakeup alone authorizes "
"acknowledging an already pending raw PWR WUF."
msgstr "[in] 稳定选项且 standby=true；只有 discard_wakeup 授权确认已待处理的原始 PWR WUF。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "[in] Existing suspended RTC face; never a second hardware owner."
msgstr "[in] 已有且已挂起的 RTC 接口；不得建立第二个硬件所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "[inout] Exact successful RTC standby_prepare receipt."
msgstr "[inout] 精确且成功的 RTC standby_prepare 回执。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "[out] Distinct timer epoch receipt, including spurious return."
msgstr "[out] 独立定时器纪元回执，包含伪返回情况。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid ""
"IO on returning Standby, or a pre-entry/restore failure. Real Standby resets"
" and never returns. A failed restore retains its receipt."
msgstr "Standby 返回或进入前／恢复失败时返回 IO。真实 Standby 复位且不返回。恢复失败保留回执。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "Translate a deadline across the exact recorded old/new epochs."
msgstr "在精确记录的新旧纪元之间转换截止时间。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid ""
"Pure bounded arithmetic. The caller samples/qualifies the independent RTC "
"and accounts for sample windows, drift and unavailable intervals. The result"
" is an envelope, not permission to restart OS/request state."
msgstr "纯有界算术。调用者采样并验证独立 RTC，计入采样窗口、漂移和不可用区间。结果是范围包络，不授予重启 OS／请求状态的权限。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "[in] Successful STOP receipt from the same retained boot."
msgstr "[in] 同一次保留启动中的成功 STOP 回执。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "[in] Explicit epoch of deadline_us, must match receipt."
msgstr "[in] deadline_us 的显式纪元，必须与回执匹配。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "[in] Old-domain absolute deadline, including UINT64_MAX."
msgstr "[in] 旧域绝对截止时间，包含 UINT64_MAX。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "[in] Independent source's lower elapsed-time bound."
msgstr "[in] 独立来源的已过时间下界。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "[in] Independent source's upper elapsed-time bound."
msgstr "[in] 独立来源的已过时间上界。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "[out] Distinct call-owned bounds in the new timer domain."
msgstr "[out] 新定时器域内独立调用期边界。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID/STATE/OVERFLOW without modifying output."
msgstr "成功返回 SUCCESS；失败返回 INVALID／STATE／OVERFLOW，并保持输出不变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "Explicit regulator, wake routes and authorization to discard WUF."
msgstr "显式稳压器、唤醒路线及丢弃 WUF 的授权。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid ""
"wake_pins temporarily arms explicitly selected physical wake pins. The "
"caller owns their pad/electrical plan and every pre-enabled wake source. "
"Original enable bits survive a spurious Standby return. Unimplemented IRQ "
"words/bits must be zero. F446 PC13 conflicts with crystal LSE on the "
"maintained LQFP package; no source is substituted. discard_wakeup permits "
"clearing existing PWR WUF only for Standby."
msgstr ""
"wake_pins 临时使能显式选定的物理唤醒引脚。调用者负责引脚电气计划及所有预先启用的唤醒来源。伪 Standby 返回保留原启用位。未实现的 "
"IRQ 字／位必须为零。维护的 LQFP 封装上，F446 PC13 与晶体 LSE 冲突；不替换来源。discard_wakeup 仅授权在 "
"Standby 清除既有 PWR WUF。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "Read-only retained PWR observations, not a physical wake-cause proof."
msgstr "只读保留的 PWR 观测，不构成物理唤醒原因证明。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid ""
"F479 conservatively requires a product-authorized reset before RTC Standby "
"rearm when Standby/wake flags remain. WKUP-only is unaffected."
msgstr "Standby／唤醒标志保留时，F479 保守要求产品授权复位后才可重新使能 RTC Standby。仅 WKUP 模式不受影响。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "STOP ends one boot timer epoch; no continuous Core time is claimed."
msgstr "STOP 结束一个启动定时器纪元；不声明 Core 时间连续。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/soc/stm32f4-system.md:76
msgid "A deadline translated using an independent elapsed-time envelope."
msgstr "依据独立已过时间包络转换的截止时间。"
